+### ID8 widget wake extension
+
+The local ID8 build accepts `{"op":"widget-wake"}` from a connected vehicle-data client after a real wake cycle enters FULL_ON_USER_ON. It rearms an existing selected-widget request after 300 ms, including when no content size update arrives. It does not select a widget that has never been shown in this service session. The JS client exposes `wakeWidget()`. Older and ID7 servers do not implement this extension.
